#: reveal-ids-for-wp-admin-25.php:378
msgid "All options to enable/disable the display of IDs have been removed in version 1.3.0! If you would like to hide the ID column on a specific panel, just remove it in the options panel."
msgstr "從 1.3.0 版開始，移除全部啟用/停用顯示 ID 的設定；如需在指定面板隱藏 ID 欄位，請在指定面板頁面的 [顯示項目設定] 分頁中設定。"

#: reveal-ids-for-wp-admin-25.php:400
msgid "<strong>Reveal IDs</strong> 1.3.0 and above require at least WordPress 3.0! If you're still using a WP version prior to 3.0, please <a href='%s'>use Reveal IDs version 1.2.7</a>! Consider updating to the latest WP version for your own safety!"
msgstr "<strong>Reveal IDs</strong> 1.3.0 及更新版本需要的 WordPress 最低版本需求為 3.0 版。如果這個網站仍使用早於 WordPress 3.0 之前的版本，請<a href='%s'>改用 Reveal IDs 1.2.7 版</a>！將網站的 WordPress 更新至最新版能為網站提供更加安全的保障。"